{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"hellowind777.hellogrok.CLI","latestVersion":"0.1.41","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Console-only CLI of hellogrok, a local proxy that makes Grok Build custom model channels work with common API formats, native Web tools, isolated authentication, and automatic configuration recovery.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Console-only CLI of hellogrok, a local proxy that makes Grok Build custom model channels work with common API formats, native Web tools, isolated authentication, and automatic configuration recovery.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Grok Build can use custom model endpoints, but real-world providers do not all expose the same protocol, response shape, authentication method, or Web-search behavior. hellogrok provides one local compatibility layer for those custom channels: it prepares the required Grok configuration while running, keeps each channel tied to its own endpoint and credentials, supports Grok Build native Web workflows, and restores the original configuration when stopped. This console-only build runs the same proxy from the terminal without the tray application; run `hellogrok help` for the full CLI reference (start, version, routes, restore, autostart, log, logview).","name":"hellogrok-cli","packageUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok","publisher":"hellowind777","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#0141-2026-09-20","tags":["grok","grok-build","proxy"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"hellogrok 的命令行版本——跨平台 Grok Build 本地代理，让自定义模型渠道兼容常见 API 格式、Build 原生 Web 工具、独立鉴权和自动配置恢复。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Grok Build 可以接入自定义模型端点，但不同服务商实际提供的协议、响应格式、鉴权方式和 Web 搜索能力并不一致。hellogrok 为这些自定义渠道提供统一的本地兼容层：运行时准备 Grok 必需配置，让每个渠道固定使用自己的端点和凭据，支持 Grok Build 原生 Web 工作流，并在停止时恢复原始配置。本版本为纯命令行构建，不包含托盘程序；运行 `hellogrok help` 可查看完整的命令参考（start、version、routes、restore、autostart、log、logview）。","tags":["grok","grok-build","代理"]}},"longDescription":"Grok Build can use custom model endpoints, but real-world providers do not all expose the same protocol, response shape, authentication method, or Web-search behavior. hellogrok provides one local compatibility layer for those custom channels: it prepares the required Grok configuration while running, keeps each channel tied to its own endpoint and credentials, supports Grok Build native Web workflows, and restores the original configuration when stopped. This console-only build runs the same proxy from the terminal without the tray application; run `hellogrok help` for the full CLI reference (start, version, routes, restore, autostart, log, logview).","name":"hellogrok-cli","packageUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok","publisher":"hellowind777","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#0141-2026-09-20","tags":["grok","grok-build","proxy"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.41/app.json","detailSha256":"148562f9a3d41ba39b396dae4c3633214c9948da18c3ab6620cfd20a8bbfd631","releaseDate":"2026-09-20","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.41"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.40/app.json","detailSha256":"9c28e339d9a76a74bc34deedb0b3cdf119163f02689bab0fcc3f216a0d5bff80","releaseDate":"2026-09-17","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.40"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.39/app.json","detailSha256":"6633d3cdce06e68b62258cc5d6113d4fe8c955eaa4bee904970af1432f4431f6","releaseDate":"2026-09-17","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.39"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detai